{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49714","headline":"河传 二 · 孙光宪","name":"河传 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳拖金缕，着烟笼雾，蒙蒙落絮。\n凤皇舟上楚女，妙舞，雷喧波上鼓。\n龙争虎战分中土，人无主，桃叶江南渡。\n襞花牋，艳思牵，成篇，宫娥相与传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}